    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1859">

                <pb facs="1480" n="1364" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/180.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In the annual message of the President to the Congress, delivered to-day, is a
                    most cordial reference to your visit here and to the relations of the two
                    countries. It was enthusiastically received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Northcott</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
